## 💻 Court Laptop (F5)

- Desktop with a folder for every module — you only see what your court role allows (server decides)
- Windows with **Back / ESC**, minimize to taskbar, size slider
- **Help** card for every command — nobody has to memorize anything
- **🚨 Judicial Police badge** on the taskbar blinks while a request waits
- **Database editor** for server owners (whitelisted tables, locked keys, history + Restore, ACE-only)
- **Admin** folder: DOJ roles + audit log

## ⚖️ Court

- Cases, hearings, jury selection, verdicts, appeals, expungement, plea deals
- **37 A4 legal forms × 5 languages** (EN / HR / DE / FR / ES) — print to an inventory item, court seal, Discord transcripts
- Arrest & search warrants, bail / bond, fines + fine calculator
- **In-game penal code editor** — prices, prison time, texts in 5 languages, activate / deactivate articles
- Court procedure: arraignment, public defender, bench warrants, probation & community service, restraining orders, pre-trial detention limits, contempt of court
- Courtroom session: all rise / order in the court / recess, minutes to Discord, projector, gavel with real sound
- Public court board, bar exam & licences, attorney appointments, DOJ treasury

## 🚔 Judicial Police

- Court protection · transport to court · transport to jail (right after the verdict) · arrests · house-arrest violations
- **Your own police units** (any job names, e.g. LSPD, BCSO, judicial police, SWAT) with command grades
- **Routing per request type** — first units alarmed at once, fallback units if nobody claims in time
- Scheduling rules (e.g. court protection min. 2 h ahead, arrests immediate)
- Repeating alarm + SMS + dispatch only for **on-duty** officers, until someone claims it
- **GPS route on the minimap** for the assigned officer (prison ↔ court, live position for arrests)
- **Walk-through metal detectors** at the courthouse

## 🏠 House Arrest

- Home zone + radius, visible ankle monitor, live map in the laptop, violation alerts, auto-revoke + warrant, bolt-cutter item

